WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:08.760
Proofs of service: photos and video of the sacrifice or distribution for the donor, so they see where their gift went.

2
00:00:09.311 --> 00:00:13.010
Click "Proof of service" and enter the gift's reference.

3
00:00:13.563 --> 00:00:15.750
Upload the photo or video.

4
00:00:16.301 --> 00:00:20.080
Click "Send to the donor"; it goes to the donor in the chat.

5
00:00:20.632 --> 00:00:23.130
Don't show recipients' faces.
